<title>SINGAPORE: LC Dev up on takeover rumours - dealers.</title>
<headline>LC Dev up on takeover rumours - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of LC Development Ltd, the property arm of Lum Chang Holdings Ltd, rose to a new year high on Monday on takeover rumours, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0340 GMT, the share price was up six cents at Singapore $1.33 after hitting a year high at S$1.37. Volume was at 1.09 million shares.</p>
<p>One dealer said it was old rumours of a possible takeover of the company resurfacing.</p>
<p>LC Development officials were not available for comments.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
</text>
